<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '32px 56px 24px 56px' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 84, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 44, background: '#3B82F6' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
            人和 AI 各自负责什么
        </Text>
    </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 548, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                分工的前提
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.76)', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                AI 生成速度快，但不掌握业务口径，也不对结果负责。分工按两件事划分：谁掌握信息，谁承担后果。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 16 }} />
            <Box style={{
                background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)', borderLeft: '4px solid #3B82F6',
                borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                    口径由人拍板
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.55, fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                    指标定义、排除范围、拦截策略这类决定写进配置，AI 负责按配置生成与校验，不自行补充。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.66)', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                交付物中的数值均来自可复现的脚本输出，不采用估算与印象值。
            </Text>
        </Box>

                <Box style={{ width: 806, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Table
                style={{ width: '100%', height: 330 }}
                defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 13, textAlign: 'left', fontFamily: '微软雅黑', color: '#0F172A' }}
                defaultCellStyle={{
                    padding: 9,
                    border: {
                        left: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.12)' },
                        right: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.12)' },
                        top: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.12)' },
                        bottom: { width: 1, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.12)' },
                    },
                }}
                cells={[
                    [
                        { text: '阶段', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#06B6D4' } } },
                        { text: '人负责', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#06B6D4' } } },
                        { text: 'AI 负责', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 14 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#06B6D4' } } },
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '需求界定', textStyle: { bold: true } },
                        '定范围、定验收标准',
                        '提供候选方案与遗漏项提示',
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '架构与约束', textStyle: { bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.04)' } } },
                        { text: '拍板分层硬约束与技术取舍', cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.04)' } } },
                        { text: '给出候选结构与代价分析', cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.04)' } } },
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '语义层与守卫', textStyle: { bold: true } },
                        '确认口径、排除范围与拦截策略',
                        '生成配置初稿与逐条对应用例',
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '用例与评测', textStyle: { bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.04)' } } },
                        { text: '定义判据与每道题的期望值', cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.04)' } } },
                        { text: '批量产出题目并跑回归', cellStyle: { background: { color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.04)' } } },
                    ],
                    [
                        { text: '文档与交付', textStyle: { bold: true } },
                        '定结构与措辞口径',
                        '起草初稿与跨文档一致性检查',
                    ],
                ]}
            />

            <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                三条经验，各有出处
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
                {[
                    ['先定约束再写代码', '三条分层硬约束动手前写死，返工集中在配置而非代码结构。'],
                    ['中间数值逐条核对', '评测报告按题列出命中项，四类召回缺陷由此定位。'],
                    ['报错原样回传', '数据库原始报错交给模型修正，效果优于让它自查。'],
                ].map((row, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{
                        flex: 1, background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)', borderRadius: 8,
                        padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7,
                        borderTop: '3px solid #3B82F6',
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                            {row[0]}
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.74)', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                            {row[1]}
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 32, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.60)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
            Text2SQL 电商数据分析 Agent
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(15,23,42,0.60)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>11 / 12</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
